        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597710/extras/ee6c2c2c4f018822aaacf6099b7e0aa3.poster.avif?t=1765560200\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597710/extras/ee6c2c2c4f018822aaacf6099b7e0aa3.webm?t=1765560200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the mystical Huddle Stone shattered, it broke reality across seven penguin realms. Now young Kaito must venture through these corrupted dimensions, hurling snowballs at tough enemies while navigating treacherous platforming challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Snowball Combat - Throw snowballs in multiple directions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Platforming - Jump, dash, and dive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 7 Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•~40 Enemies, 15 Bosses (7 mini, 7 main, and 1 final)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Basic Parry Mechanics - dash or dive at pink projectiles to earn mana</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A few Items &amp; Perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Basic Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Janky animations made by me</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597710/extras/ee6c2c2c4f018822aaacf6099b7e0aa3.poster.avif?t=1765560200\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597710/extras/ee6c2c2c4f018822aaacf6099b7e0aa3.webm?t=1765560200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the mystical Huddle Stone shattered, it broke reality across seven penguin realms. Now young Kaito must venture through these corrupted dimensions, hurling snowballs at tough enemies while navigating treacherous platforming challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Snowball Combat - Throw snowballs in multiple directions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Platforming - Jump, dash, and dive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 7 Levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•~40 Enemies, 15 Bosses (7 mini, 7 main, and 1 final)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Basic Parry Mechanics - dash or dive at pink projectiles to earn mana</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A few Items &amp; Perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Basic Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Janky animations made by me</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
